su name script file teaching be refinery def
exists su name video cuts images directory ob text "/workplace/examples/out/canada-warning-cuts" be default ya
exists su name video cuts audio filename ob text "/workplace/examples/out/canada-warning.wav" be default ya
exists su name video cuts prefix ob text "canada-warning" be default ya
su name manuscript from filename "/workplace/examples/pyash/fixtures/teaching-script-canada-warning.txt" become wo text to name text manuscript out be read do
su name telling from ve name manuscript ob name manuscript out to filename "/workplace/examples/out/canada-warning.wav" be piper say do
su name footnote from ve name telling from filename "/workplace/examples/out/canada-warning.wav" become wo srt to filename "/workplace/examples/out/canada-warning.srt" be hear do
su name cut platform from filename "/workplace/examples/out/canada-warning.srt" during num 6 to name itinerary canada warning cuts be cut do
su name draw platform from name itinerary canada warning cuts ob text "Generate one illustration per cut from its footnote text." fromstate wo text become wo photograph to filename "/workplace/examples/out/canada-warning-cuts" as text "canada-warning" be draw do
su name concatenate platform from name itinerary canada warning cuts fromstate wo itinerary become wo video to filename "/workplace/examples/out/canada-warning.mp4" be concatenate do
su name report ob text "Generated /workplace/examples/out/canada-warning.mp4" be write do
prah

from name script file teaching be refinery do
ob text "ls -lh /workplace/examples/out/canada-warning.mp4" to name text video preview be command do
ob name video preview be write do
